{"alias":"/learning/II/techpblhome/logistics","title":"Logistics of Instruction Technology and Interdisciplinary Instruction","changed":"2026-04-06T23:02:56+00:00","before":"<img alt=\"This page focuses on three instructional technology ideas that can be used to make teaching through interdisciplinary instruction more efficient\" data-align=\"center\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c027a4e4-a575-4277-b345-da93c15a473b\" height=\"312\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Powtoon_GIF%20%287%29.gif\" width=\"553\" />\r\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\r\n\t<dt>Learning Management Systems</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K5_TSNMFj1Y\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Click this <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yRqEgIU_EB35c10vT9sCP4SfUd6wQ_mf4T1kurFyQRo/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">link</a> to take a self-guided tour of an LMS.</p>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n\t<dt>English for Speakers of Other Languages</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UDmWQ3-j_xQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\r\n\r\n\t<p class=\"text-align-center\">Click this <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1XBltVg_tf3zgE0xz16khaBDSTPPzQ3u3Nzp1SJtDm84/copy\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">link</a> to plan how to support multilingual learners in interdisciplinary or project-based learning.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<h5 class=\"text-align-center\"><strong>Resources</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n\t<p class=\"text-align-center\"><a href=\"ht